      "worked": "The July decrease is calculated from the increased salary.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{January increase}&=\\frac{12}{100}\\times\\$800\\\\\\text{January increase}&=\\$96\\\\\\text{January salary}&=\\$800+\\$96\\\\\\text{January salary}&=\\$896\\\\\\text{July decrease}&=\\frac{8}{100}\\times\\$896\\\\\\text{July decrease}&=\\$71.68\\\\\\text{July salary}&=\\$896-\\$71.68\\\\\\text{July salary}&=\\$824.32\\end{align*}$$\n\nHer salary after the decrease is $\\$824.32$ per week.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
